  <h1>Present continuous: <em>happening now</em></h1>
  <p class="standfirst">Present an action as open and in progress now or temporarily around now: <span class="ex">I’m waiting for the bus</span>, <span class="ex">She’s working from home this week</span>, and <span class="ex">Are they still talking?</span> Build the complete form, contrast it with routines and states, and recognize arranged future meaning from clear context.</p>
