    <div class="flow-step"><b>Use</b><span>Describe a clear pictured, stated, or invented situation.</span></div>
  </div>

  <p class="note-line">The core meaning is an open situation viewed from inside. Context can place that open situation at this moment, temporarily around now, or in a clearly arranged future.</p>

  <h2>Two-minute retrieval</h2>
  <div class="lead-rule"></div>
  <div class="practice" data-choice-gap-drill data-success-message="Correct. You retrieved am with I, are with the plural subject my parents, and present-simple works with Omar's stated routine.">
