    <div class="q"><span class="n">3</span><span>Omar’s schedule says he regularly <button class="choice-gap" data-choice-gap data-answer="works" data-hint="A regular schedule with he takes works in the present simple." data-fix="Omar works long hours at the clinic." data-placeholder="choose">choose</button> long hours at the clinic.</span></div>
    <div class="drill-actions">
      <button class="lesson-btn" data-check-choices>Check</button>
      <button class="lesson-btn" data-reset-choices>Reset</button>
    </div>
